# First Class Tonight!

Hi Drummers!! tonight will be the first night of our second course for this year! It feels like forever since we have seen you all.  Nathaniel has an exciting set of rhythms for you this time round and of course he will be sharing what he has been learning in Mali. So, the new venue for our classes is @ The Neighbourhood Centre in Maleny. 6-7pm.  See you there like a bear! :)
